          "y": 358.619195809304,
          "z": 64,
          "w": 340,
          "text": "As you get more experienced you can share your own snippets with the community. Other's can then star your figlets and run then in their own files."
        },
        {
          "id": "n13-md",
          "type": "md",
          "x": 152.51317147745715,
          "y": 1335.8618429664111,
          "z": 73,
          "w": 340,
          "text": "Space is precious inside Figma so I wanted to be able to expand and collapse the plugin UI when it felt appropriate. Pages such as list views, settings, and logout collapse automatically, while code views expand automatically."
        },
        {
          "id": "n14-tblock",
          "type": "tblock",
